Task: Standardize inline validations and API errors in EventRegistrationModal.tsx
Summary of changes:
- Converted client-side validation errors in EventRegistrationModal.tsx from global toasts to inline input field helper texts.
- Restructured projectValidationError to be rendered directly under the project field as error helper text instead of showing a banner alert.
- Enabled inline clearing of errors as the user modifies the inputs.
